sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Editor as Segmentation Editor
    participant Effect as New Effect
    participant PrevEffect as Active Effect
    participant Scene
    participant LayerDM as Layer Displayable Manager
    participant Pipeline as Effect Pipeline

    App ->> Editor: set_active_effect_type(effect_type)
    opt Effect type not registered
        Editor ->> Effect: Create + set scene / editor
    end
    Editor ->> PrevEffect: Deactivate
    Editor ->> Scene: Add effect parameter node
    Scene ->> LayerDM: Node added
    LayerDM ->> Editor: Try create pipeline(view, parameter)
    Editor ->> Effect: create_pipeline(view, parameter)
    Effect ->> Pipeline: Create
    Editor ->> Pipeline: Set view
    Editor ->> Effect: Activate
    Editor ->> App: active_effect_name_changed
